  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "FCREPO uses the json-ld-1.0 processing mode, but it will silently accept version 1.1 which it doesn’t process.  This can lead to users getting different data out from they thought they put in. ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Adding ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "type": "code"
        }
       ],
       "text": "“@version\": 1.1",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "text": " to the concept does stop processing ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "An upgrade to json-ld version 1.1 would be a nice improvement, better documentation in the API specs might alert users.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Here’s an example that can cause developers days for confusion ",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "attrs": {
        "id": "1f642",
        "shortName": ":slight_smile:",
        "text": "🙂"
       },
       "type": "emoji"
      },
      {
       "text": " ",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "json"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "{\n  \"@context\": {\n    \"@vocab\": \"http://vivoweb.org/ontology/core#\",\n    \"vcard\": \"http://www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#\",\n    \"person\": \"http://ucdavis.edu/person/\",\n    \"hasName\": {\n      \"@id\": \"vcard:hasName\",\n      \"@type\": \"@id\",\n      \"@context\": {\n        \"family\": {\n          \"@id\": \"vcard:familyName\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  \"@id\": \"person:quinn\",\n  \"hasName\": {\n    \"@id\": \"person:quinn#name\",\n    \"family\": \"Hart\"\n  }\n}\n",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    }
   ],
