  "description": "<p>FCREPO uses the json-ld-1.0 processing mode, but it will silently accept version 1.1 which it doesn’t process.  This can lead to users getting different data out from they thought they put in. </p>\n\n<p>Adding <tt>“@version\": 1.1</tt> to the concept does stop processing </p>\n\n<p>An upgrade to json-ld version 1.1 would be a nice improvement, better documentation in the API specs might alert users.</p>\n\n<p>Here’s an example that can cause developers days for confusion 🙂 </p>\n\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-json\">{\n  <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@context\"</span>: {\n    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@vocab\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//vivoweb.org/ontology/core#\"</span>,\n</span>    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"vcard\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/2006/vcard/ns#\"</span>,\n</span>    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"person\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//ucdavis.edu/person/\"</span>,\n</span>    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"hasName\"</span>: {\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@id\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"vcard:hasName\"</span>,\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@type\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@id\"</span>,\n      <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@context\"</span>: {\n        <span class=\"code-quote\">\"family\"</span>: {\n          <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@id\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"vcard:familyName\"</span>\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  },\n  <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@id\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"person:quinn\"</span>,\n  <span class=\"code-quote\">\"hasName\"</span>: {\n    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"@id\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"person:quinn#name\"</span>,\n    <span class=\"code-quote\">\"family\"</span>: <span class=\"code-quote\">\"Hart\"</span>\n  }\n}\n</pre>\n</div></div>",
